动修复，不要臆造字段。\n\n\n你是 Python 数据分析助手。代码仅在客户沙箱中执行，只输出纯 Python。客户数据通过沙箱提供的 get_connection() 获取 DB-API 连接；禁止编造或填写连接参数，禁止使用 pymysql.connect、SQLAlchemy create_engine、读取平台配置或输出任何凭据。get_connection 由沙箱预置：严禁定义、重写、赋值或写占位实现 def get_connection()，直接调用即可；调用后先判断连接是否为 None，为 None 立即抛出明确错误，不要继续 cursor。只能执行只读 MySQL  查询，所有条件值使用 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤1：查询所有客户及其关联的合同信息，包括合同金额、客户分级、行业等画像数据，并关联ERP销售订单以获取实际销售金额和BOM成本数据，计算毛利率\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("数据库连接不可用")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    sql = """\n     \n        c.customer_code,\n        c.customer_name,\n        c.short_name,\n        c.customer_level,\n        c.industry,\n        c.credit_rating,\n        ct.contract_no,\n        ct.contract_name,\n        ct.total_amount AS contract_amount,\n        ct.sign_date,\n        ct.status AS contract_status,\n        so.order_no,\n        so.total_amount AS sales_order_amount,\n        soi.product_id,\n        soi.quantity,\n        soi.unit_price,\n        soi.amount AS line_amount,\n        m.material_code,\n        m.material_name,\n        m.standard_cost,\n        bom.id AS bom_id,\n        bom_item.qty_per,\n        bom_item.loss_rate\n    FROM nova_crm.crm_customer c\n    INNER JOIN nova_crm.crm_contract ct ON c.id = ct.customer_id AND ct.is_deleted = 0\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_sales_order so ON ct.contract_no = so.contract_no AND so.is_deleted = 0\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_sales_order_item soi ON so.id = soi.order_id\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_product p ON soi.product_id = p.id\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON p.id = m.product_id AND m.is_deleted = 0\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_bom bom ON m.id = bom.material_id AND bom.status = 2\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_bom_item bom_item ON bom.id = bom_item.bom_id\n    WHERE c.is_deleted = 0\n    ORDER BY c.customer_code, ct.contract_no, so.order_no\n    """\n    \n    cursor.execute(sql)\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    df_raw = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=columns)\n    \n    if df_raw.empty:\n        print("未查询到任何客户合同数据")\n    else:\n        # 计算每个销售订单行的BOM物料成本\n        # 逻辑：对于自制件，其成本由BOM子件构成。这里简化处理：\n        # 如果存在BOM，则单位成本 = SUM(子件标准成本 * (1+损耗率) * 用量 / base_qty)\n        # 由于SQL中已经关联了bom_item，我们需要在Python中进行聚合计算\n        \n        # 首先，按订单行分组，计算该行的总BOM成本\n        # 注意：一个产品可能对应多个BOM版本或无BOM（采购件）。\n        # 这里假设我们取最新的已发布BOM，或者简单地对所有关联的BOM行求和（这可能导致重复计算如果有多层BOM，但表结构显示是单层展开还是多层？erp_bom支持多层，但erp_bom_item直接指向component_material_id。通常成本卷积需要递归。鉴于复杂度，这里采用一种近似策略：\n        # 策略：如果产品有BOM，则其单位材料成本估算为 BOM中所有直接子件的 standard_cost * qty_per * (1 + loss_rate/100)。\n        # 如果子件也是自制件且有BOM，这种简单方法会低估成本。但为了“全方位分析”且避免无限递归SQL，我们先计算直接材料成本。\n        \n        # 重新构建数据结构以便计算\n        # 1. 提取唯一的产品ID及其对应的BOM信息来计算单位成本\n        product_bom_df = df_raw[[\'product_id\', \'material_id\', \'standard_cost\', \'qty_per\', \'loss_rate\']].drop_duplicates(subset=[\'product_id\', \'material_id\', \'qty_per\', \'loss_rate\'])\n        \n        # 过滤掉没有BOM信息的行（即采购件或无BOM定义）\n        has_bom_mask = ~product_bom_df[\'qty_per\'].isna()\n        bom_items_only = product_bom_df[has_bom_mask].copy()\n        \n        if not bom_items_only.empty:\n            # 计算每个父件产品的单位BOM成本\n            # 公式: sum(子件标准成本 * 用量 * (1 + 损耗率/100))\n            bom_items_only[\'unit_bom_cost\'] = bom_items_only[\'standard_cost\'] * bom_items_only[\'qty_per\'] * (1 + bom_items_only[\'loss_rate\']/100)\n            \n            # 按父件产品ID聚合\n            product_unit_cost_df = bom_items_only.groupby(\'product_id\')[\'unit_bom_cost\'].sum().reset_index()\n            product_unit_cost_df.rename(columns={\'unit_bom_cost\': \'calculated_bom_unit_cost\'}, inplace=True)\n            \n            # 将计算出的BOM单位成本合并回主表\n            df_raw = df_raw.merge(product_unit_cost_df, on=\'product_id\', how=\'left\')\n        else:\n            df_raw[\'calculated_bom_unit_cost\'] = 0\n            \n        # 对于没有BOM成本的产品（如采购件），使用其自身的标准成本作为参考成本\n        # 如果 calculated_bom_unit_cost 为空，则 fallback 到 material.standard_cost (如果有的话) 或 0\n        df_raw[\'final_unit_cost\'] = df_raw.apply(\n            lambda row: row[\'calculated_bom_unit_cost\'] if pd.notna(row[\'calculated_bom_unit_cost\']) and row[\'calculated_bom_unit_cost\'] > 0 else (row[\'standard_cost\'] if pd.notna(row[\'standard_cost\']) else 0),\n            axis=1\n        )\n        \n        # 计算每行的毛利\n        # 销售额 = line_amount (不含税)\n        # 成本 = final_unit_cost * quantity\n        df_raw[\'sales_revenue\'] = df_raw[\'line_amount\']\n        df_raw[\'total_cost\'] = df_raw[\'final_unit_cost\'] * df_raw[\'quantity\']\n        df_raw[\'gross_profit\'] = df_raw[\'sales_revenue\'] - df_raw[\'total_cost\']\n        df_raw[\'gross_margin_rate\'] = df_raw.apply(\n            lambda row: (row[\'gross_profit\'] / row[\'sales_revenue\'] * 100) if row[\'sales_revenue\'] != 0 else 0,\n            axis=1\n        )\n        \n        # 按客户和合同维度汇总分析\n        # 1. 客户画像与合同概览\n        customer_contract_summary = df_raw.groupby([\n            \'customer_code\', \'customer_name\', \'short_name\', \'customer_level\', \'industry\', \'credit_rating\',\n            \'contract_no\', \'contract_name\', \'contract_amount\', \'sign_date\', \'contract_status\'\n        ]).agg(\n            total_sales_amount=(\'sales_revenue\', \'sum\'),\n            total_cost=(\'total_cost\', \'sum\'),\n            total_gross_profit=(\'gross_profit\', \'sum\'),\n            order_count=(\'order_no\', \'nunique\')\n        ).reset_index()\n        \n        customer_contract_summary[\'avg_gross_margin_rate\'] = customer_contract_summary.apply(\n            lambda row: (row[\'total_gross_profit\'] / row[\'total_sales_amount\'] * 100) if row[\'total_sales_amount\'] != 0 else 0,\n            axis=1\n        )\n        \n        # 2. 客户整体画像汇总\n        customer_overall_summary = df_raw.groupby([\n            \'customer_code\', \'customer_name\', \'short_name\', \'customer_level\', \'industry\', \'credit_rating\'\n        ]).agg(\n            contract_count=(\'contract_no\', \'nunique\'),\n            total_contract_value=(\'contract_amount\', \'sum\'), # 注意：这里可能有重复累加如果多行对应同一合同，需去重后求和，但groupby后sum会重复。\n            # 修正：先对合同金额去重再求和比较困难，这里改为统计实际产生的销售总额和利润\n            total_actual_sales=(\'sales_revenue\', \'sum\'),\n            total_actual_cost=(\'total_cost\', \'sum\'),\n            total_actual_profit=(\'gross_profit\', \'sum\')\n        ).reset_index()\n        \n        # 重新计算合同总金额以避免重复累加问题：单独查询或使用更复杂的聚合\n        # 简单起见，我们在上面的 customer_contract_summary 中已经有了准确的 per-contract 数据。\n        # 现在基于 customer_contract_summary 再次聚合得到客户级汇总\n        customer_final_profile = customer_contract_summary.groupby([\n            \'customer_code\', \'customer_name\', \'short_name\', \'customer_level\', \'industry\', \'credit_rating\'\n        ]).agg(\n            num_contracts=(\'contract_no\', \'count\'),\n            sum_contract_amount=(\'contract_amount\', \'sum\'),\n            sum_sales_revenue=(\'total_sales_amount\', \'sum\'),\n            sum_total_cost=(\'total_cost\', \'sum\'),\n            sum_gross_profit=(\'total_gross_profit\', \'sum\')\n        ).reset_index()\n        \n        customer_final_profile[\'overall_gross_margin_rate\'] = customer_final_profile.apply(\n            lambda row: (row[\'sum_gross_profit\'] / row[\'sum_sales_revenue\'] * 100) if row[\'sum_sales_revenue\'] != 0 else 0,\n            axis=1\n        )\n        \n        # 输出结果\n        print("="*80)\n        print("【1】客户合同详细分析表 (按合同维度)")\n        print("="*80)\n        # 格式化数字\n        cols_to_format = [\'contract_amount\', \'total_sales_amount\', \'total_cost\', \'total_gross_profit\', \'avg_gross_margin_rate\']\n        for col in cols_to_format:\n            if col in customer_contract_summary.columns:\n                customer_contract_summary[col] = customer_contract_summary[col].round(2)\n                \n        print(customer_contract_summary.to_string(index=False))\n        \n        print("\\n" + "="*80)\n        print("【2】客户整体画像与盈利汇总 (按客户维度)")\n        print("="*80)\n        cols_to_format_cust = [\'sum_contract_amount\', \'sum_sales_revenue\', \'sum_total_cost\', \'sum_gross_profit\', \'overall_gross_margin_rate\']\n        for col in cols_to_format_cust:\n            if col in customer_final_profile.columns:\n                customer_final_profile[col] = customer_final_profile[col].round(2)\n                \n        print(customer_final_profile.to_string(index=False))\n        \n        print("\\n" + "="*80)\n        print("【3】全局财务指标摘要")\n        print("="*80)\n        total_contracts = len(customer_contract_summary)\n        total_customers = len(customer_final_profile)\n        global_sales = customer_final_profile[\'sum_sales_revenue\'].sum()\n        global_cost = customer_final_profile[\'sum_total_cost\'].sum()\n        global_profit = customer_final_profile[\'sum_gross_profit\'].sum()\n        global_margin = (global_profit / global_sales * 100) if global_sales != 0 else 0\n        \n        print(f"涉及客户总数: {total_customers}")\n        print(f"涉及合同总数: {total_contracts}")\n        print(f"实际销售总额: {global_sales:.2f} 元")\n        print(f"实际物料成本总额: {global_cost:.2f} 元")\n        print(f"实际毛利润总额: {global_profit:.2f} 元")\n        print(f"综合毛利率: {global_margin:.2f}%")\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: KeyError: "[\'material_id\'] not in index"\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pan