到上方表结构核对真实物理字段名，再做自动修复，不要臆造字段。\n\n\n你是 Python 数据分析助手。代码仅在客户沙箱中执行，只输出纯 Python。客户数据通过沙箱提供的 get_connection() 获取 DB-API 连接；禁止编造或填写连接参数，禁止使用 pymysql.connect、SQLAlchemy create_engine、读取平台配置或输出任何凭据。get_connection 由沙箱预置：严禁定义、重写、赋值或写占位实现 def get_connection()，直接调用即可；调用后先判断连接是否为 None，为 None 立即抛出明确错误，不要继续 cursor。只能执行只读 MySQL SELECT 查询，所有条件值使用 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤1：查询所有已生效销售合同及其关联的ERP销售订单、客户信息，计算合同总销售额（基于ERP销售订单明细汇总）\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection is not available")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor(dictionary=True)\n\ntry:\n    sql = """\n    SELECT \n        c.contract_no,\n        c.contract_name,\n        c.customer_id,\n        cust.customer_code,\n        cust.customer_name,\n        cust.short_name,\n        cust.industry,\n        cust.customer_level,\n        c.total_amount as contract_total_amount,\n        c.sign_date,\n        c.effective_date,\n        c.expire_date,\n        c.status as contract_status,\n        so.order_no,\n        so.id as sales_order_id,\n        so.total_amount as erp_order_total_amount,\n        so.discount_amount,\n        so.tax_amount,\n        so.payable_amount,\n        so.order_date,\n        so.delivery_date,\n        so.status as order_status,\n        soi.product_id,\n        soi.product_code,\n        soi.product_name,\n        soi.quantity,\n        soi.unit_price,\n        soi.amount as line_amount,\n        soi.delivered_qty\n    FROM nova_crm.crm_contract c\n    JOIN nova_crm.crm_customer cust ON c.customer_id = cust.id AND cust.is_deleted = 0\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_sales_order so ON c.erp_order_no = so.order_no AND so.is_deleted = 0\n    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_sales_order_item soi ON so.id = soi.order_id\n    WHERE c.is_deleted = 0\n      AND c.status IN (3, 4)\n    ORDER BY c.contract_no, so.order_no, soi.line_no\n    """\n    \n    cursor.execute(sql)\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    if not rows:\n        print("未查询到已生效的销售合同数据")\n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\'contract_ids\': [], \'sales_order_ids\': []}))\n    else:\n        # Process data to calculate total sales per contract based on ERP order items\n        from collections import defaultdict\n        \n        contract_data = defaultdict(lambda: {\n            \'contract_info\': None,\n            \'customer_info\': None,\n            \'orders\': defaultdict(lambda: {\'order_info\': None, \'items\': []}),\n            \'total_erp_sales\': Decimal(\'0\')\n        })\n        \n        for row in rows:\n            c_no = row[\'contract_no\']\n            \n            if contract_data[c_no][\'contract_info\'] is None:\n                contract_data[c_no][\'contract_info\'] = {\n                    \'contract_no\': c_no,\n                    \'contract_name\': row[\'contract_name\'],\n                    \'sign_date\': str(row[\'sign_date\']) if row[\'sign_date\'] else None,\n                    \'effective_date\': str(row[\'effective_date\']) if row[\'effective_date\'] else None,\n                    \'expire_date\': str(row[\'expire_date\']) if row[\'expire_date\'] else None,\n                    \'contract_status\': row[\'contract_status\'],\n                    \'contract_total_amount\': float(row[\'contract_total_amount\']) if row[\'contract_total_amount\'] else 0\n                }\n                \n            if contract_data[c_no][\'customer_info\'] is None:\n                contract_data[c_no][\'customer_info\'] = {\n                    \'customer_code\': row[\'customer_code\'],\n                    \'customer_name\': row[\'customer_name\'],\n                    \'short_name\': row[\'short_name\'],\n                    \'industry\': row[\'industry\'],\n                    \'customer_level\': row[\'customer_level\']\n                }\n            \n            o_no = row[\'order_no\']\n            if o_no:\n                if contract_data[c_no][\'orders\'][o_no][\'order_info\'] is None:\n                    contract_data[c_no][\'orders\'][o_no][\'order_info\'] = {\n                        \'order_no\': o_no,\n                        \'sales_order_id\': row[\'sales_order_id\'],\n                        \'erp_order_total_amount\': float(row[\'erp_order_total_amount\']) if row[\'erp_order_total_amount\'] else 0,\n                        \'discount_amount\': float(row[\'discount_amount\']) if row[\'discount_amount\'] else 0,\n                        \'tax_amount\': float(row[\'tax_amount\']) if row[\'tax_amount\'] else 0,\n                        \'payable_amount\': float(row[\'payable_amount\']) if row[\'payable_amount\'] else 0,\n                        \'order_date\': str(row[\'order_date\']) if row[\'order_date\'] else None,\n                        \'delivery_date\': str(row[\'delivery_date\']) if row[\'delivery_date\'] else None,\n                        \'order_status\': row[\'order_status\']\n                    }\n                \n                if row[\'product_id\']:\n                    item = {\n                        \'product_id\': row[\'product_id\'],\n                        \'product_code\': row[\'product_code\'],\n                        \'product_name\': row[\'product_name\'],\n                        \'quantity\': float(row[\'quantity\']) if row[\'quantity\'] else 0,\n                        \'unit_price\': float(row[\'unit_price\']) if row[\'unit_price\'] else 0,\n                        \'line_amount\': float(row[\'line_amount\']) if row[\'line_amount\'] else 0,\n                        \'delivered_qty\': float(row[\'delivered_qty\']) if row[\'delivered_qty\'] else 0\n                    }\n                    contract_data[c_no][\'orders\'][o_no][\'items\'].append(item)\n                    contract_data[c_no][\'total_erp_sales\'] += Decimal(str(row[\'line_amount\'])) if row[\'line_amount\'] else Decimal(\'0\')\n        \n        # Print summary table\n        print(f"{\'合同编号\':<15} | {\'客户名称\':<20} | {\'合同金额\':>12} | {\'ERP销售总额\':>12} | {\'订单数\':>6}")\n        print("-" * 80)\n        \n        all_contract_nos = []\n        all_sales_order_ids = []\n        \n        for c_no, data in sorted(contract_data.items()):\n            cust_name = data[\'customer_info\'][\'customer_name\'] if data[\'customer_info\'] else \'N/A\'\n            contract_amt = data[\'contract_info\'][\'contract_total_amount\'] if data[\'contract_info\'] else 0\n            erp_sales = float(data[\'total_erp_sales\'])\n            order_count = len(data[\'orders\'])\n            \n            print(f"{c_no:<15} | {cust_name:<20} | {contract_amt:>12.2f} | {erp_sales:>12.2f} | {order_count:>6}")\n            \n            all_contract_nos.append(c_no)\n            for o_no, o_data in data[\'orders\'].items():\n                if o_data[\'order_info\'] and o_data[\'order_info\'][\'sales_order_id\']:\n                    all_sales_order_ids.append(o_data[\'order_info\'][\'sales_order_id\'])\n        \n        print("-" * 80)\n        print(f"总计: {len(all_contract_nos)} 份合同, {len(set(all_sales_order_ids))} 个关联销售订单")\n        \n        # Prepare handoff data\n        unique_so_ids = list(set(all_sales_order_ids))\n        print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps({\n            \'contract_nos\': all_contract_nos,\n            \'sales_order_ids\': unique_so_ids\n        }))\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: TypeError: Connection.cursor() got an unexpected keyword argument \'dictionary\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否