        \n                if bom_row:\n                    has_bom = True\n                    bom_id = bom_row[0]\n                    base_qty = get_decimal(bom_row[1])\n                    if base_qty == 0: base_qty = 1.0\n                    \n                    # Calculate unit cost from BOM items\n                    # Cost = SUM(Component.StandardCost * Component.QtyPer) / BaseQty\n                    sql_bom_items = """\n                    SELECT m.standard_cost, bi.qty_per\n                    FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item bi\n                    JOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON bi.component_material_id = m.id\n                    WHERE bi.bom_id = %s\n                    """\n                    cursor.execute(sql_bom_items, (bom_id,))\n                    bom_items = cursor.fetchall()\n                    \n                    total_unit_cost = 0.0\n                    for b_item in bom_items:\n                        comp_std_cost = get_decimal(b_item[0])\n                        qty_per = get_decimal(b_item[1])\n                        total_unit_cost += comp_std_cost * qty_per\n                    \n                    unit_cost = total_unit_cost / base_qty\n                else:\n                    # No BOM -> Cost = 0 per rule\n                    unit_cost = 0.0\n            else:\n                unit_cost = 0.0\n                \n            total_sales = sale_price * qty\n            total_cost = unit_cost * qty\n            \n            results.append({\n                "Customer": customer_name,\n                "Product Code": product_code if product_code else material_code,\n                "Product Name": product_name if product_name else material_name,\n                "Quantity": qty,\n                "Unit Sale Price": round(sale_price, 2),\n                "Total Sales Amount": round(total_sales, 2),\n                "Has BOM": "Yes" if has_bom else "No",\n                "Unit Cost": round(unit_cost, 4),\n                "Total Cost": round(total_cost, 2),\n                "Gross Profit": round(total_sales - total_cost, 2),\n                "Margin %": round((total_sales - total_cost)/total_sales * 100, 2) if total_sales > 0 else 0\n            })\n            \n        df_result = pd.DataFrame(results)\n        \n        # Print Summary\n        print(f"Analysis for Customer: {customer_name}")\n        print(df_result.to_string(index=False))\n        \n        # Overall Totals\n        overall_sales = df_result[\'Total Sales Amount\'].sum()\n        overall_cost = df_result[\'Total Cost\'].sum()\n        overall_profit = overall_sales - overall_cost\n        overall_margin = (overall_profit / overall_sales * 100) if overall_sales > 0 else 0\n        \n        print("\\n--- Contract Summary ---")\n        print(f"Total Contract Sales Value: {overall_sales:.2f}")\n        print(f"Total Estimated Cost: {overall_cost:.2f}")\n        print(f"Total Gross Profit: {overall_profit:.2f}")\n        print(f"Overall Gross Margin: {overall_margin:.2f}%")\n\nfinally:\n    if conn:\n        conn.rollback()\n        conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nAnalysis for Customer: 海纳动力系统股份有限公司\n    Customer Product Code  Product Name  Quantity  Unit Sale Price  Total Sales Amount Has BOM  Unit Cost  Total Cost  Gross Profit  Margin %\n海纳动力系统股份有限公司      SKU0002  激光测距仪 激光-598        10          47170.0            471700.0     Yes 34670.1339   346701.34     124998.66     26.50\n海纳动力系统股份有限公司      SKU0004 PU气动软管 PU-671        10            459.0              4590.0      No     0.0000        0.00       4590.00    100.00\n海纳动力系统股份有限公司      SKU0016  码垛机器人 码垛-418        10         282401.0           2824010.0     Yes 26611.3244   266113.24    2557896.76     90.58\n\n--- Contract Summary ---\nTotal Contract Sales Value: 3300300.00\nTotal Estimated Cost: 612814.58\nTotal Gross Profit: 2687485.42\nOverall Gross Margin: 81.43%\n```\n\n\n请遵循系统设定的主技能规则口径，依据上述执行结果，用通俗易懂的语言给业务用户一份最终 Markdown 总结：\n1. 屏蔽所有技术细节（SQL、表名、代码、字段名一律不出现）；\n2. 