ms. Let\'s assume the input strings are product_codes or names.\n        # Given the format \'SKU: 激光-215\', it\'s highly likely these are product_code values in erp_product.\n        \n        skus = [\'激光-215\', \'PU-804\', \'码垛-418\']\n        \n        placeholders = \', \'.join([\'%s\'] * len(skus))\n        sql_products = f"""\n            SELECT id as product_id, product_code, product_name, sale_price, unit\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_product\n            WHERE product_code IN ({placeholders}) AND is_deleted = 0\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_products, tuple(skus))\n        products_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        product_info_list = []\n        for p in products_rows:\n            product_info_list.append({\n                "product_id": int(p[\'product_id\']),\n                "product_code": p[\'product_code\'],\n                "product_name": p[\'product_name\'],\n                "sale_price": float(p[\'sale_price\']),\n                "unit": p[\'unit\']\n            })\n            \n        handoff_data = {\n            "customer_code": customer_code,\n            "product_info": product_info_list\n        }\n        \n        print(f"Customer Code: {customer_code}")\n        print("Products found:")\n        for item in product_info_list:\n            print(item)\n            \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f"Error: {e}")\n    handoff_data = {\n        "customer_code": None,\n        "product_info": []\n    }\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.close()\n\nprint(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: TypeError: Connection.cursor() got an unexpected keyword argument \'dictionary\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /、+、-、*