2026-10-31 18:33:27,683 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-57a5492c-0168-467b-b986-a8580bd21203', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-31 18:33:27（周六）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。按照用户提问为准该时间只是校准用，不作为业务时间（除用户提出今天或者等等意图时才可以带入）。\n\n【主技能画像】\n- 技能ID: 36\n- 技能名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率\n- 技能描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【主技能规则口径】\n1，产品的成本以erp_material表为准\n2，需要计算材料成本时以BOM表为准\n\n【本次执行单元清单】\n- 技能ID: 36, 名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率, 描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【技能组全局设定】\n技能组：nova系统\nerp+crm客户与销售产线系统合并技能\n\n你是负责最终业务总结的助手。请对本次技能的执行结果做业务解读与总结。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：海纳动力要购买一批激光测距仪 激光-215数量10个、PU气动软管 PU-804数量10个、码垛机器人 码垛-418数量10个，需要开合同销售价格多少钱，我们的产品成本是多少\n\n【技能各执行单元的过程与结果】\n## 执行单元【分析客户合同销售毛利率】结果\n\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：查询客户\'海纳动力\'的客户编码，并获取激光测距仪(SKU: 激光-215)、PU气动软管(SKU: PU-804)、码垛机器人(SKU: 码垛-418)在ERP中的商品ID、物料ID及标准销售价\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection is not available")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\n# 1. Query customer code for \'海纳动力\'\nsql_customer = """\nSELECT customer_code, id \nFROM nova_crm.crm_customer \nWHERE customer_name LIKE %s AND is_deleted = 0\n"""\nparams_customer = (\'%海纳动力%\',)\ncursor.execute(sql_customer, params_customer)\ncustomer_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n\nif not customer_rows:\n    print("未找到客户 \'海纳动力\'")\n    customer_code = None\nelse:\n    # Assuming tuple result: (customer_code, id)\n    customer_code = customer_rows[0][0]\n    print(f"Found Customer Code: {customer_code}")\n\n# 2. Query product details (ID, Standard Sale Price) from ERP based on SKU/product_code\nskus = [\'激光-215\', \'PU-804\', \'码垛-418\']\n\nplaceholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(skus))\nsql_products = f"""\nSELECT \n    p.id as product_id,\n    p.product_code,\n    p.product_name,\n    p.sale_price,\n    m.id as material_id,\n    m.material_code,\n    m.material_name,\n    m.standard_cost\nFROM nova_erp.erp_product p\nJOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON p.id = m.product_id\nWHERE p.product_code IN ({placeholders})\nAND p.is_deleted = 0\nAND m.is_deleted = 0\n"""\nparams_products = tuple(skus)\ncursor.execute(sql_products, params_products)\nproduct_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n\nprint("\\n--- Product Details ---")\nproducts_list = []\nfor row in product_rows:\n    # Tuple indices based on SELECT order:\n    # 0: product_id, 1: product_code, 2: product_name, 3: sale_price, 4: material_id, 5: material_code, 6: material_name, 7: standard_cost\n    pid = int(row[0])\n    pcode = row[1]\n    pname = row[2]\n    psale = float(row[3]) if isinstance(row[3], Decimal) else row[3]\n    mid = int(row[4])\n    mcode = row[5]\n    mname = row[6]\n    mcost = float(row[7]) if isinstance(row[7], Decimal) else row[7]\n    \n    print(f"SKU: {pcode}, Name: {pname}, Sale Price: {psale}, Material ID: {mid}, Std Cost: {mcost}")\n    \n    products_list.append({\n        \'product_id\': pid,\n        \'product_code\': pcode,\n        \'material_id\': mid,\n        \'sale_price\': psale,\n        \'standard_cost\': mcost\n    })\n\nhandoff_data = {\n    \'customer_code\': customer_code,\n    \'products\': products_list\n}\n\nprint(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\ncursor.close()\nconn.rollback()\nconn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nFound Customer Code: CUS0006\n\n--- Product Details ---\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：基于步骤1获取的物料ID，通过BOM表(nova_erp.erp_bom)和BOM明细表(nova_erp.erp_bom_item)递归或关联查询各产品的子件物料清单，并结合nova_erp.erp_material表获取子件的标准成本，计算单件产品的材料总成本\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\nimport pandas as pd\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_0e8b533a0e\n    customer_code = handoff_data.get(\'customer_code\')\n    products_info = handoff_data.get(\'products\', [])\n    \n    if not products_info:\n        print("No products found in handoff data.")\n        df_result = pd.DataFrame(columns=[\'product_name\', \'material_id\', \'unit_cost\', \'total_material_cost\'])\n    else:\n        material_ids = [p[\'material_id\'] for p in products_info]\n        \n        # 1. Get product names and standard costs from erp_material for the finished goods themselves (in case they are purchased or have no BOM)\n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(material_ids))\n        sql_product_base = f"""\n        SELECT id, material_name, standard_cost \n        FROM nova_erp.erp_material \n        WHERE id IN ({placeholders}) AND is_deleted = 0\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_product_base, tuple(material_ids))\n        rows_product_base = cursor.fetchall()\n        cols_product_base = [\'id\', \'material_name\', \'standard_cost\']\n        df_product_base = pd.DataFrame(rows_product_base, columns=cols_product_base)\n        df_product_base[\'standard_cost\'] = df_product_base[\'standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n        \n        # Map material_id to name for later use\n        mat_id_to_name = dict(zip(df_product_base[\'id\'], df_product_base[\'material_name\']))\n        \n        # 2. Find published BOMs for these materials\n        sql_bom_head = f"""\n        SELECT bom.id as bom_id, bom.material_id as parent_material_id, bom.base_qty\n        FROM nova_erp.erp_bom bom\n        WHERE bom.material_id IN ({placeholders}) \n          AND bom.status = 2 \n          AND bom.is_deleted = 0\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_bom_head, tuple(material_ids))\n        rows_bom_head = cursor.fetchall()\n        cols_bom_head = [\'bom_id\', \'parent_material_id\', \'base_qty\']\n        df_bom_head = pd.DataFrame(rows_bom_head, columns=cols_bom_head)\n        \n        if not df_bom_head.empty:\n            df_bom_head[\'base_qty\'] = df_bom_head[\'base_qty\'].astype(float)\n            \n            # 3. Get BOM items for these BOMs\n            bom_ids = df_bom_head[\'bom_id\'].tolist()\n            placeholders_bom = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(bom_ids))\n            sql_bom_items = f"""\n            SELECT item.bom_id, item.component_material_id, item.qty_per, item.loss_rate\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item item\n            WHERE item.bom_id IN ({placeholders_bom})\n            """\n            cursor.execute(sql_bom_items, tuple(bom_ids))\n            rows_bom_items = cursor.fetchall()\n            cols_bom_items = [\'bom_id\', \'component_material_id\', \'qty_per\', \'loss_rate\']\n            df_bom_items = pd.DataFrame(rows_bom_items, columns=cols_bom_items)\n            \n            if not df_bom_items.empty:\n                df_bom_items[\'qty_per\'] = df_bom_items[\'qty_per\'].astype(float)\n                df_bom_items[\'loss_rate\'] = df_bom_items[\'loss_rate\'].astype(float)\n                \n                # Merge with BOM head to get base_qty and parent_material_id\n                df_bom_full = df_bom_items.merge(df_bom_head, on=\'bom_id\', how=\'left\')\n                \n                # Calculate effective quantity per unit of parent product\n                # Formula: (qty_per / base_qty) * (1 + loss_rate/100)\n                df_bom_full[\'effective_qty\'] = (df_bom_full[\'qty_per\'] / df_bom_full[\'base_qty\']) * (1 + df_bom_full[\'loss_rate\'] / 100)\n                \n                # 4. Get component material details (name and standard cost)\n                comp_mat_ids = df_bom_full[\'component_material_id\'].unique().tolist()\n                placeholders_comp = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(comp_mat_ids))\n                sql_comp_mats = f"""\n                SELECT id, material_name, standard_cost\n                FROM nova_erp.erp_material\n                WHERE id IN ({placeholders_comp}) AND is_deleted = 0\n                """\n                cursor.execute(sql_comp_mats, tuple(comp_mat_ids))\n                rows_comp_mats = cursor.fetchall()\n                cols_comp_mats = [\'id\', \'material_name\', \'standard_cost\']\n                df_comp_mats = pd.DataFrame(rows_comp_mats, columns=cols_comp_mats)\n                df_comp_mats[\'standard_cost\'] = df_comp_mats[\'standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n                \n                # Merge component costs into BOM full\n                df_bom_full = df_bom_full.merge(\n                    df_comp_mats[[\'id\', \'material_name\', \'standard_cost\']], \n                    left_on=\'component_material_id\', \n                    right_on=\'id\', \n                    how=\'left\'\n                )\n                \n                # Calculate line cost\n                df_bom_full[\'line_cost\'] = df_bom_full[\'effective_qty\'] * df_bom_full[\'standard_cost\']\n                \n                # Aggregate by parent material ID\n                df_cost_agg = df_bom_full.groupby(\'parent_material_id\').agg(\n                    total_material_cost=(\'line_cost\', \'sum\')\n                ).reset_index()\n                \n                # Merge back with product base info\n                df_final = df_product_base.merge(df_cost_agg, left_on=\'id\', right_on=\'parent_material_id\', how=\'left\')\n                df_final[\'total_material_cost\'] = df_final[\'total_material_cost\'].fillna(0).astype(float)\n                \n                # If a product has no BOM, its material cost might be considered as its own standard cost? \n                # The prompt says "calculate single product material total cost" based on BOM. \n                # Usually, if it\'s a purchased part (no BOM), the cost is the purchase price or standard cost.\n                # However, strictly following "BOM table... calculate material cost", if no BOM exists, sum is 0.\n                # But often standard_cost IS the cost for non-BOM items. Let\'s check if we should fallback to standard_cost if no BOM.\n                # Given the rule "Product cost is based on erp_material", and "Calculate material cost based on BOM".\n                # For self-made items, BOM calculates it. For purchased items, standard_cost is likely the cost.\n                # Let\'s assume if total_material_cost is 0 (no BOM found), we use standard_cost as the material cost proxy.\n                df_final[\'final_unit_cost\'] = df_final.apply(\n                    lambda row: row[\'total_material_cost\'] if row[\'total_material_cost\'] > 0 else row[\'standard_cost\'], axis=1\n                )\n                \n                # Prepare output dataframe\n                df_output = df_final[[\'material_name\', \'id\', \'final_unit_cost\']].copy()\n                df_output.columns = [\'product_name\', \'material_id\', \'unit_material_cost\']\n                \n                # Add quantity from handoff to calculate total cost for the order\n                qty_map = {p[\'material_id\']: p[\'quantity\'] for p in products_info}\n                df_output[\'order_quantity\'] = df_output[\'material_id\'].map(qty_map)\n                df_output[\'total_order_material_cost\'] = df_output[\'unit_material_cost\'] * df_output[\'order_quantity\']\n                \n                # Sort to match input order roughly\n                input_order = [p[\'material_id\'] for p in products_info]\n                df_output[\'sort_key\'] = df_output[\'material_id\'].apply(lambda x: input_order.index(x) if x in input_order else -1)\n                df_output = df_output.sort_values(\'sort_key\').drop(columns=[\'sort_key\'])\n                \n                print(df_output.to_string(index=False))\n            else:\n                print("No BOM items found for the specified products.")\n                # Fallback: Use standard cost directly\n                df_output = df_product_base.copy()\n                df_output[\'unit_material_cost\'] = df_output[\'standard_cost\']\n                qty_map = {p[\'material_id\']: p[\'quantity\'] for p in products_info}\n                df_output[\'order_quantity\'] = df_output[\'id\'].map(qty_map)\n                df_output[\'total_order_material_cost\'] = df_output[\'unit_material_cost\'] * df_output[\'order_quantity\']\n                df_output = df_output.rename(columns={\'material_name\': \'product_name\', \'id\': \'material_id\'})\n                print(df_output[[\'product_name\', \'material_id\', \'unit_material_cost\', \'order_quantity\', \'total_order_material_cost\']].to_string(index=False))\n        else:\n            print("No published BOMs found for the specified products.")\n            # Fallback: Use standard cost directly\n            df_output = df_product_base.copy()\n            df_output[\'unit_material_cost\'] = df_output[\'standard_cost\']\n            qty_map = {p[\'material_id\']: p[\'quantity\'] for p in products_info}\n            df_output[\'order_quantity\'] = df_output[\'id\'].map(qty_map)\n            df_output[\'total_order_material_cost\'] = df_output[\'unit_material_cost\'] * df_output[\'order_quantity\']\n            df_output = df_output.rename(columns={\'material_name\': \'product_name\', \'id\': \'material_id\'})\n            print(df_output[[\'product_name\', \'material_id\', \'unit_material_cost\', \'order_quantity\', \'total_order_material_cost\']].to_string(index=False))\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nNo products found in handoff data.\n```\n\n\n请遵循系统设定的主技能规则口径，依据上述执行结果，用通俗易懂的语言给业务用户一份最终 Markdown 总结：\n1. 屏蔽所有技术细节（SQL、表名、代码、字段名一律不出现）；\n2. 若包含多个执行单元，先分单元给出核心结论，再进行整体综合分析与建议；\n3. 若某单元无有效结果或执行失败，如实简要说明，不要编造数据；\n4. 【数据一律表格化】凡是指标、数值、排行、对比、分类汇总、明细清单这类数据，一律用 Markdown 表格呈现，不要写成大段文字或纯项目符号；表格必须有表头，数值列标注单位与统计口径（时间范围、分组维度、币种等），小数位与执行结果精度保持一致，空值/缺失值明确写“无数据”，不得留空或擅自补 0；\n5. 【分析类必须给出数据依据】先给核心指标的数值与对比基准（同比/环比/占比/目标值），再说明样本量与覆盖范围（时间跨度、记录条数、覆盖客户/合同/产品数量），对异常值、极值、缺失项单独说明可能原因；既不能只给结论不给数据，也不能只堆明细不做归纳；\n6. 明细较多时，先给按关键维度聚合的汇总表，再补 Top N 或代表性明细，并注明筛选、排序与聚合口径，避免把原始明细逐行罗