n    "targetTableId": 129,\n    "relationContent": "一张领料单头对应多条领料明细行",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "issue_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 137,\n    "targetTableId": 138,\n    "relationContent": "一条工艺路线头对应多条工序明细",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "routing_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 144,\n    "targetTableId": 145,\n    "relationContent": "一张生产工单对应多条工单工序执行记录",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "wo_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 127,\n    "targetTableId": 126,\n    "relationContent": "物料主数据关联库存余额，一个物料在多个仓库有库存记录",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "material_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 143,\n    "targetTableId": 126,\n    "relationContent": "仓库档案关联库存余额，一个仓库包含多种物料的库存记录",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "warehouse_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 127,\n    "targetTableId": 144,\n    "relationContent": "物料主数据关联生产工单，工单针对特定自制件物料进行生产",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "material_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 137,\n    "targetTableId": 144,\n    "relationContent": "工艺路线关联生产工单，工单执行时固化引用的工艺路线版本",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "routing_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 130,\n    "targetTableId": 138,\n    "relationContent": "工序字典关联工艺路线明细，定义工艺路线中具体的加工步骤",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "process_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  },\n  {\n    "sourceTableId": 139,\n    "targetTableId": 140,\n    "relationContent": "销售订单头关联销售订单明细，一条订单对应多条商品行",\n    "sourceColumn": "id",\n    "targetColumn": "order_id",\n    "remarks": null\n  }\n]\n\n【客户沙箱数据访问】\n使用沙箱提供的 get_connection()，通过 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定查询。不需要也不得索取、输出或猜测数据库连接信息。查询后回滚只读事务并关闭连接。\n**SQL 注意**：所有 SQL 必须为 MySQL 兼容语法；若代码执行报“字段不存在”等错误，请先回到上方表结构核对真实物理字段名，再做自动修复，不要臆造字段。\n\n\n你是 Python 数据分析助手。代码仅在客户沙箱中执行，只输出纯 Python。客户数据通过沙箱提供的 get_connection() 获取 DB-API 连接；禁止编造或填写连接参数，禁止使用 pymysql.connect、SQLAlchemy create_engine、读取平台配置或输出任何凭据。get_connection 由沙箱预置：严禁定义、重写、赋值或写占位实现 def get_connection()，直接调用即可；调用后先判断连接是否为 None，为 None 立即抛出明确错误，不要继续 cursor。只能执行只读 MySQL SELECT 查询，所有条件值使用 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列与 SUM/AVG/COUNT 结果在 Python 中是 decimal.Decimal：单值先 float()；pandas 整列先 df[col] = df[col].astype(float) 或 df = df.apply(pd.to_numeric, errors=\'coerce\') 再参与除法/百分比运算，禁止 Decimal 与 float 直接混算。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤4：基于步骤3获取的物料ID，若物料为自制件(source_type=1)，则通过nova_erp.erp_bom和nova_erp.erp_bom_item递归或汇总计算BOM材料成本；若为采购件，则取nova_erp.erp_material.standard_cost作为成本。最终输出合同建议销售价格（含税）、预估总成本及库存充足性结论\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport json\n\nhandoff = _HANDOFF_f60ab8691c\nitem_details = handoff.get(\'item_details\', [])\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("数据库连接不可用")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor(dictionary=True)\n\nresults = []\n\nfor item in item_details:\n    input_name = item[\'input_name\']\n    input_spec = item[\'input_spec\']\n    required_qty = float(item[\'required_qty\'])\n    material_id = item.get(\'material_id\')\n    sale_price = item.get(\'sale_price\')\n    tax_rate = item.get(\'tax_rate\')\n    available_qty = item.get(\'available_qty\')\n    \n    if not material_id or sale_price is None:\n        results.append({\n            \'产品名称\': input_name,\n            \'规格型号\': input_spec,\n            \'数量\': required_qty,\n            \'合同单价(不含税)\': 0,\n            \'合同总价(含税)\': 0,\n            \'单位成本\': 0,\n            \'总成本\': 0,\n            \'库存可用量\': 0,\n            \'库存是否充足\': \'数据缺失\'\n        })\n        continue\n    \n    sql_material = """\n    SELECT source_type, standard_cost \n    FROM nova_erp.erp_material \n    WHERE id = %s AND is_deleted = 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_material, (material_id,))\n    mat_info = cursor.fetchone()\n    \n    if not mat_info:\n        results.append({\n            \'产品名称\': input_name,\n            \'规格型号\': input_spec,\n            \'数量\': required_qty,\n            \'合同单价(不含税)\': float(sale_price),\n            \'合同总价(含税)\': float(sale_price) * required_qty * (1 + float(tax_rate)/100),\n            \'单位成本\': 0,\n            \'总成本\': 0,\n            \'库存可用量\': float(available_qty) if available_qty else 0,\n            \'库存是否充足\': \'物料信息缺失\'\n        })\n        continue\n    \n    source_type = int(mat_info[\'source_type\'])\n    standard_cost = float(mat_info[\'standard_cost\']) if mat_info[\'standard_cost\'] else 0.0\n    unit_cost = 0.0\n    \n    if source_type == 1:\n        sql_bom = """\n        SELECT b.id, b.base_qty, b.yield_rate\n        FROM nova_erp.erp_bom b\n        WHERE b.material_id = %s AND b.status = 2 AND b.bom_type IN (1, 2)\n        ORDER BY b.effective_date DESC LIMIT 1\n        """\n        cursor.execute(sql_bom, (material_id,))\n        bom_head = cursor.fetchone()\n        \n        if bom_head:\n            bom_id = bom_head[\'id\']\n            base_qty = float(bom_head[\'base_qty\']) if bom_head[\'base_qty\'] else 1.0\n            yield_rate = float(bom_head[\'yield_rate\']) if bom_head[\'yield_rate\'] else 100.0\n            \n            sql_items = """\n            SELECT bi.component_material_id, bi.qty_per, bi.loss_rate, m.standard_cost\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item bi\n            JOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON bi.component_material_id = m.id\n            WHERE bi.bom_id = %s AND m.is_deleted = 0\n            """\n            cursor.execute(sql_items, (bom_id,))\n            bom_items = cursor.fetchall()\n            \n            total_component_cost = 0.0\n            for bi in bom_items:\n                qty_per = float(bi[\'qty_per\']) if bi[\'qty_per\'] else 0.0\n                loss_rate = float(bi[\'loss_rate\']) if bi[\'loss_rate\'] else 0.0\n                comp_std_cost = float(bi[\'standard_cost\']) if bi[\'standard_cost\'] else 0.0\n                \n                effective_qty = qty_per * (1 + loss_rate / 100.0)\n                component_cost = effective_qty * comp_std_cost\n                total_component_cost += component_cost\n            \n            if base_qty > 0 and yield_rate > 0:\n                unit_cost = (total_component_cost / base_qty) * (100.0 / yield_rate)\n            else:\n                unit_cost = standard_cost\n        else:\n            unit_cost = standard_cost\n    elif source_type == 2:\n        unit_cost = standard_cost\n    else:\n        unit_cost = standard_cost\n    \n    contract_unit_price_ex_tax = float(sale_price)\n    tax_rate_val = float(tax_rate) if tax_rate else 0.0\n    contract_total_incl_tax = contract_unit_price_ex_tax * required_qty * (1 + tax_rate_val / 100.0)\n    total_cost = unit_cost * required_qty\n    stock_avail = float(available_qty) if available_qty else 0.0\n    is_sufficient = "是" if stock_avail >= required_qty else "否"\n    \n    results.append({\n        \'产品名称\': input_name,\n        \'规格型号\': input_spec,\n        \'数量\': required_qty,\n        \'合同单价(不含税)\': round(contract_unit_price_ex_tax, 2),\n        \'合同总价(含税)\': round(contract_total_incl_tax, 2),\n        \'单位成本\': round(unit_cost, 4),\n        \'总成本\': round(total_cost, 2),\n        \'库存可用量\': stock_avail,\n        \'库存是否充足\': is_sufficient\n    })\n\ncursor.close()\nconn.rollback()\nconn.close()\n\nprint(f"{\'产品名称\':<15} | {\'规格型号\':<12} | {\'数量\':>6} | {\'合同单价(不含税)\':>16} | {\'合同总价(含税)\':>14} | {\'单位成本\':>10} | {\'总成本\':>12} | {\'库存可用量\':>10} | {\'库存是否充足\':>10}")\nprint("-" * 130)\nfor r in results:\n    print(f"{r[\'产品名称\']:<15} | {r[\'规格型号\']:<12} | {r[\'数量\']:>6.2f} | {r[\'合同单价(不含税)\']:>16.2f} | {r[\'合同总价(含税)\']:>14.2f} | {r[\'单位成本\']:>10.4f} | {r[\'总成本\']:>12.2f} | {r[\'库存可用量\']:>10.2f} | {r[\'库存是否充足\']:>10}")\n\ntotal_contract_value = sum(r[\'合同总价(含税)\'] for r in results)\ntotal_estimated_cost = sum(r[\'总成本\'] for r in results)\noverall_stock_status = all(r[\'库存是否充足\'] == \'是\' for r in results)\n\nprint("\\n--- 汇总分析 ---")\nprint(f"合同建议销售总金额（含税）：{total_contract_value:.2f} 元")\nprint(f"预估产品总成本：{total_estimated_cost:.2f} 元")\nprint(f"整体库存充足性结论：{\'全部充足\' if overall_stock_status else \'存在不足\'}")\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: TypeError: Connection.cursor() got an unexpected keyword argument \'dictionary\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /、+、-、*），说明 MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列或 SUM/AVG 聚合结果返回的是 Decimal，必须在参与除法、百分比等运算前转成 float：单值用 float(x)；pandas 整列用 df[col] = df[col].astype(float) 或 df = df.apply(pd.to_numeric, errors=\'coerce\') 后再运算，不要在未转换的 Series 上直接做算术；round() 之后也要 float() 才能 json.dumps。\n5. 如果提示“无输出”，说明代码执行完没有 print 任何内容。请补上 print(...)，把本步结果（如 df.to_string(index=False) 或关键数值）以纯文本打印出来，否则后续步骤和最终总结拿不到数据。\n6. 如果报错提到“定义了 get_connection()”或 \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'，说明你在代码里自己定义或占位实现了 get_connection。该函数由沙箱预置，必须删掉你的 def get_connection，直接调用 get_connection()，也不要给 get_connection 赋值。\n请输出修复后的纯 Python 代码内容，不要包含任何 Markdown 标记（如 ```python 等）。'}], 'model': 'qwen3.8-flash', 'temperature': 0.3}, 'extra_json': {'enable_thinking': False}}
