2026-10-31 18:51:54,205 - openai._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-6a649d6a-2c52-4959-87b9-bdb2bbb548a4', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '【当前系统时间】\n2026-10-31 18:51:54（周六）\n涉及日期、时间、时效性判断（如“今天”“本月”“最近”）时，一律以上述时间为基准，不得臆造、替换或推算错误的时间。当用户未提出时间内容时不要随意推算或带入当前时间。按照用户提问为准该时间只是校准用，不作为业务时间（除用户提出今天或者等等意图时才可以带入）。\n\n【主技能画像】\n- 技能ID: 36\n- 技能名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率\n- 技能描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【主技能规则口径】\n1，产品的成本以erp_material表为准\n2，需要计算材料成本时以BOM表为准\n3，根据提问需要区分内容是产品名称还是sku\n\n【本次执行单元清单】\n- 技能ID: 36, 名称: 分析客户合同销售毛利率, 描述: crm和erp进行组合分析技能\n\n【技能组全局设定】\n技能组：nova系统\nerp+crm客户与销售产线系统合并技能\n\n你是负责最终业务总结的助手。请对本次技能的执行结果做业务解读与总结。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '用户原始问题：海纳动力现在要采购一批钣金电控柜外壳*10\n大理石检测平台*10\n光谱测量模块*10，你帮我算一下需要开合同销售价格多少钱，我们的产品成本是多少、库存是否足够\n\n【技能各执行单元的过程与结果】\n## 执行单元【分析客户合同销售毛利率】结果\n\n### 步骤 1: 步骤1：根据用户提供的产品名称（钣金电控柜外壳、大理石检测平台、光谱测量模块）在 nova_erp.erp_product 表中查询对应的 product_id、product_code、sale_price（标准销售价）以及关联的 material_id（通过 erp_material.product_id 关联），并计算合同销售价格总额（数量*单价）。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("数据库连接不可用")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    product_names = [\'钣金电控柜外壳\', \'大理石检测平台\', \'光谱测量模块\']\n    quantities = {\'钣金电控柜外壳\': 10, \'大理石检测平台\': 10, \'光谱测量模块\': 10}\n    \n    placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(product_names))\n    sql = f"""\n        SELECT \n            p.id as product_id,\n            p.product_code,\n            p.product_name,\n            p.sale_price,\n            m.id as material_id,\n            m.material_code,\n            m.material_name,\n            m.standard_cost\n        FROM nova_erp.erp_product p\n        LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON p.id = m.product_id AND m.is_deleted = 0\n        WHERE p.product_name IN ({placeholders})\n          AND p.is_deleted = 0\n    """\n    \n    cursor.execute(sql, product_names)\n    rows = cursor.fetchall()\n    columns = [desc[0] for desc in cursor.description]\n    \n    results = []\n    total_sale_amount = 0\n    \n    for row in rows:\n        record = dict(zip(columns, row))\n        name = record[\'product_name\']\n        qty = quantities.get(name, 0)\n        sale_price = float(record[\'sale_price\']) if record[\'sale_price\'] is not None else 0.0\n        standard_cost = float(record[\'standard_cost\']) if record[\'standard_cost\'] is not None else 0.0\n        \n        line_sale_total = qty * sale_price\n        total_sale_amount += line_sale_total\n        \n        results.append({\n            \'product_name\': name,\n            \'product_id\': int(record[\'product_id\']),\n            \'product_code\': record[\'product_code\'],\n            \'material_id\': int(record[\'material_id\']) if record[\'material_id\'] is not None else None,\n            \'material_code\': record[\'material_code\'],\n            \'quantity\': qty,\n            \'sale_price\': sale_price,\n            \'line_sale_total\': line_sale_total,\n            \'standard_cost\': standard_cost\n        })\n    \n    print(f"{\'产品名称\':<20} {\'数量\':>6} {\'销售单价\':>12} {\'行销售总额\':>14} {\'标准成本\':>12}")\n    print("-" * 70)\n    for r in results:\n        print(f"{r[\'product_name\']:<20} {r[\'quantity\']:>6} {r[\'sale_price\']:>12.2f} {r[\'line_sale_total\']:>14.2f} {r[\'standard_cost\']:>12.2f}")\n    print("-" * 70)\n    print(f"合同销售价格总额: {total_sale_amount:.2f}")\n    \n    handoff_data = {\n        \'products\': [\n            {\n                \'product_name\': r[\'product_name\'],\n                \'product_id\': r[\'product_id\'],\n                \'material_id\': r[\'material_id\'],\n                \'quantity\': r[\'quantity\'],\n                \'sale_price\': r[\'sale_price\'],\n                \'standard_cost\': r[\'standard_cost\']\n            }\n            for r in results\n        ],\n        \'total_sale_amount\': total_sale_amount\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n    \nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\n产品名称                     数量         销售单价          行销售总额         标准成本\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n合同销售价格总额: 0.00\n```\n\n### 步骤 2: 步骤2：基于步骤1获取的 material_id，在 nova_erp.erp_inventory 表中查询各物料的当前可用库存（available_qty），判断库存是否满足采购数量（10个）的需求。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport json\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor()\n\ntry:\n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_394adb11bf\n    products = handoff_data.get(\'products\', [])\n    \n    if not products:\n        print("No products found in handoff data.")\n        result_list = []\n    else:\n        material_ids = [p[\'material_id\'] for p in products]\n        \n        placeholders = \',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(material_ids))\n        sql = f"""\n            SELECT \n                inv.material_id,\n                m.material_name,\n                m.material_code,\n                inv.available_qty,\n                inv.avg_cost\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_inventory inv\n            JOIN nova_erp.erp_material m ON inv.material_id = m.id\n            WHERE inv.material_id IN ({placeholders})\n        """\n        \n        cursor.execute(sql, material_ids)\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        \n        inventory_map = {}\n        for row in rows:\n            mid = int(row[0])\n            inventory_map[mid] = {\n                \'material_id\': mid,\n                \'material_name\': row[1],\n                \'material_code\': row[2],\n                \'available_qty\': float(row[3]),\n                \'avg_cost\': float(row[4])\n            }\n        \n        required_qty = 10\n        \n        result_list = []\n        for p in products:\n            mid = p[\'material_id\']\n            inv_info = inventory_map.get(mid)\n            \n            if inv_info:\n                avail = inv_info[\'available_qty\']\n                sufficient = "是" if avail >= required_qty else "否"\n                shortage = max(0, required_qty - avail)\n                \n                result_list.append({\n                    \'material_id\': mid,\n                    \'material_name\': inv_info[\'material_name\'],\n                    \'material_code\': inv_info[\'material_code\'],\n                    \'required_qty\': required_qty,\n                    \'available_qty\': avail,\n                    \'is_sufficient\': sufficient,\n                    \'shortage_qty\': shortage,\n                    \'avg_cost\': inv_info[\'avg_cost\']\n                })\n            else:\n                result_list.append({\n                    \'material_id\': mid,\n                    \'material_name\': p.get(\'product_name\', \'\'),\n                    \'material_code\': \'\',\n                    \'required_qty\': required_qty,\n                    \'available_qty\': 0.0,\n                    \'is_sufficient\': "否",\n                    \'shortage_qty\': required_qty,\n                    \'avg_cost\': 0.0\n                })\n\n    if result_list:\n        headers = [\'物料ID\', \'物料名称\', \'物料编码\', \'需求数量\', \'可用库存\', \'库存是否充足\', \'缺口数量\', \'平均成本\']\n        print(\'\\t\'.join(headers))\n        for item in result_list:\n            row_vals = [\n                str(item[\'material_id\']),\n                item[\'material_name\'],\n                item[\'material_code\'],\n                str(item[\'required_qty\']),\n                f"{item[\'available_qty\']:.2f}",\n                item[\'is_sufficient\'],\n                f"{item[\'shortage_qty\']:.2f}",\n                f"{item[\'avg_cost\']:.4f}"\n            ]\n            print(\'\\t\'.join(row_vals))\n    else:\n        print("No inventory data to display.")\n\n    output_handoff = {\n        \'inventory_status\': result_list\n    }\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(output_handoff))\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nNo products found in handoff data.\nNo inventory data to display.\n```\n\n### 步骤 3: 步骤3：基于步骤1获取的 material_id，在 nova_erp.erp_bom 和 nova_erp.erp_bom_item 表中查找对应的BOM结构，结合 nova_erp.erp_material 表中的 standard_cost 或 nova_erp.erp_inventory 中的 avg_cost 计算单位材料成本，进而得出总产品成本。\n**执行代码**:\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ntry:\n    cursor = conn.cursor()\n    \n    handoff_data = _HANDOFF_394adb11bf\n    products = handoff_data.get(\'products\', [])\n    \n    if not products:\n        print("No products found in handoff data.")\n    else:\n        product_names = [p[\'product_name\'] for p in products]\n        \n        sql_materials = """\n            SELECT \n                m.id AS material_id,\n                m.material_code,\n                m.material_name,\n                m.standard_cost,\n                m.source_type,\n                p.product_name,\n                p.product_code\n            FROM nova_erp.erp_material m\n            JOIN nova_erp.erp_product p ON m.product_id = p.id\n            WHERE p.product_name IN ({}) AND m.is_deleted = 0\n        """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(product_names)))\n        \n        cursor.execute(sql_materials, tuple(product_names))\n        materials_df = pd.DataFrame(cursor.fetchall(), columns=[\'material_id\', \'material_code\', \'material_name\', \'standard_cost\', \'source_type\', \'product_name\', \'product_code\'])\n        \n        if materials_df.empty:\n            print("No matching materials found in ERP.")\n        else:\n            materials_df[\'standard_cost\'] = materials_df[\'standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n            \n            material_ids = materials_df[\'material_id\'].tolist()\n            \n            sql_bom_header = """\n                SELECT \n                    b.id AS bom_id,\n                    b.material_id AS parent_material_id,\n                    b.base_qty,\n                    b.yield_rate,\n                    b.status\n                FROM nova_erp.erp_bom b\n                WHERE b.material_id IN ({}) AND b.status = 2\n            """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(material_ids)))\n            \n            cursor.execute(sql_bom_header, tuple(material_ids))\n            bom_headers_df = pd.DataFrame(cursor.fetchall(), columns=[\'bom_id\', \'parent_material_id\', \'base_qty\', \'yield_rate\', \'status\'])\n            \n            if bom_headers_df.empty:\n                print("No published BOMs found for these materials.")\n                final_results = []\n                for _, row in materials_df.iterrows():\n                    cost = row[\'standard_cost\']\n                    final_results.append({\n                        \'product_name\': row[\'product_name\'],\n                        \'material_code\': row[\'material_code\'],\n                        \'cost_type\': \'Standard Cost (No BOM)\',\n                        \'unit_cost\': cost,\n                        \'total_cost\': cost * 10\n                    })\n                df_final = pd.DataFrame(final_results)\n                print(df_final.to_string(index=False))\n            else:\n                bom_headers_df[\'base_qty\'] = bom_headers_df[\'base_qty\'].astype(float)\n                bom_headers_df[\'yield_rate\'] = bom_headers_df[\'yield_rate\'].astype(float)\n                \n                bom_ids = bom_headers_df[\'bom_id\'].tolist()\n                \n                sql_bom_items = """\n                    SELECT \n                        bi.bom_id,\n                        bi.component_material_id,\n                        bi.qty_per,\n                        bi.loss_rate,\n                        cm.material_name AS component_name,\n                        cm.standard_cost AS component_standard_cost,\n                        inv.avg_cost AS component_avg_cost\n                    FROM nova_erp.erp_bom_item bi\n                    JOIN nova_erp.erp_material cm ON bi.component_material_id = cm.id\n                    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_inventory inv ON cm.id = inv.material_id\n                    WHERE bi.bom_id IN ({})\n                """.format(\',\'.join([\'%s\'] * len(bom_ids)))\n                \n                cursor.execute(sql_bom_items, tuple(bom_ids))\n                bom_items_df = pd.DataFrame(cursor.fetchall(), columns=[\'bom_id\', \'component_material_id\', \'qty_per\', \'loss_rate\', \'component_name\', \'component_standard_cost\', \'component_avg_cost\'])\n                \n                if not bom_items_df.empty:\n                    bom_items_df[\'qty_per\'] = bom_items_df[\'qty_per\'].astype(float)\n                    bom_items_df[\'loss_rate\'] = bom_items_df[\'loss_rate\'].astype(float)\n                    bom_items_df[\'component_standard_cost\'] = bom_items_df[\'component_standard_cost\'].astype(float)\n                    bom_items_df[\'component_avg_cost\'] = bom_items_df[\'component_avg_cost\'].apply(lambda x: float(x) if pd.notnull(x) else 0.0)\n                    \n                    bom_items_df[\'effective_cost\'] = bom_items_df.apply(\n                        lambda r: r[\'component_avg_cost\'] if r[\'component_avg_cost\'] > 0 else r[\'component_standard_cost\'], axis=1\n                    )\n                    \n                    bom_items_df[\'line_cost\'] = bom_items_df[\'qty_per\'] * (1 + bom_items_df[\'loss_rate\']/100) * bom_items_df[\'effective_cost\']\n                    \n                    bom_costs = bom_items_df.groupby(\'bom_id\')[\'line_cost\'].sum().reset_index()\n                    bom_costs.columns = [\'bom_id\', \'total_component_cost\']\n                    \n                    merged_bom = pd.merge(bom_headers_df, bom_costs, on=\'bom_id\')\n                    \n                    merged_bom[\'adjusted_cost\'] = merged_bom[\'total_component_cost\'] / merged_bom[\'yield_rate\'] * 100\n                    \n                    final_material_costs = {}\n                    for _, row in merged_bom.iterrows():\n                        mat_id = row[\'parent_material_id\']\n                        cost = row[\'adjusted_cost\']\n                        if mat_id not in final_material_costs or cost > final_material_costs[mat_id]:\n                            final_material_costs[mat_id] = cost\n                    \n                    results_list = []\n                    for _, row in materials_df.iterrows():\n                        mat_id = row[\'material_id\']\n                        prod_name = row[\'product_name\']\n                        \n                        if mat_id in final_material_costs:\n                            unit_cost = final_material_costs[mat_id]\n                            cost_source = "BOM Calculated"\n                        else:\n                            unit_cost = row[\'standard_cost\']\n                            cost_source = "Standard Cost"\n                            \n                        total_cost = unit_cost * 10\n                        \n                        results_list.append({\n                            \'Product Name\': prod_name,\n                            \'Material Code\': row[\'material_code\'],\n                            \'Cost Source\': cost_source,\n                            \'Unit Cost\': round(unit_cost, 2),\n                            \'Quantity\': 10,\n                            \'Total Cost\': round(total_cost, 2)\n                        })\n                    \n                    df_results = pd.DataFrame(results_list)\n                    print(df_results.to_string(index=False))\n                else:\n                    print("No BOM items found.")\n                    results_list = []\n                    for _, row in materials_df.iterrows():\n                        unit_cost = row[\'standard_cost\']\n                        total_cost = unit_cost * 10\n                        results_list.append({\n                            \'Product Name\': row[\'product_name\'],\n                            \'Material Code\': row[\'material_code\'],\n                            \'Cost Source\': \'Standard Cost (No BOM Items)\',\n                            \'Unit Cost\': round(unit_cost, 2),\n                            \'Quantity\': 10,\n                            \'Total Cost\': round(total_cost, 2)\n                        })\n                    df_results = pd.DataFrame(results_list)\n                    print(df_results.to_string(index=False))\n\nfinally:\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n**执行结果**:\n```text\nNo products found in handoff data.\n```\n\n\n请遵循系统设定的主技能规则口径，依据上述执行结果，用通俗易懂的语言给业务用户一份最终 Markdown 总结：\n1. 屏蔽所有技术细节（SQL、表名、代码、字段名一律不出现）；\n2. 若包含多个执行单元，先分单元给出核心结论，再进行整体综合分析与建议；\n3. 若某单元无有效结果或执行失败，如实简要说明，不要编造数据；\n4. 【数据一律表格化】凡是指标、数值、排行、对比、分类汇总、明细清单这类数据，一律用 Markdown 表格呈现，不要写成大段文字或纯项目符号；表格必须有表头，数值列标注单位与统计口径（时间范围、分组维度、币种等），小数位与执行结果精度保持一致，空值/缺失值明确写“无数据”，不得留空或擅自补 0；\n5. 【分析类必须给出数据依据】先给核心指标的数值与对比基准（同比/环比/占比/目标值），再说明样本量与覆盖范围（时间跨度、记录条数、覆盖客户/合同/产品数量），对异常值、极值、缺失项单独说明可能原因；既不能只给结论不给数据，也不能只堆明细不做归纳；\n6. 明细较多时，先给按关键维度聚合的汇总表，再补 Top N 或代表性明细，并注明筛选、排序与聚合口径，避免把原始明细逐行罗列；\n7. 篇幅不设上限：执行结果里的数据、结论、异常项、原因分析和建议都要完整写出，不得为了控制长度而压缩、省略、只列要点或写“详见上文”；宁可写得长也不遗漏关键信息。\n以上关于完整性与数据呈现的要求优先于其他任何“简洁/精简/控制字数”的设定。'}], 'model': 'qwen3.8-flash', 'stream': True, 'temperature': 0.7}, 'extra_json': {'enable_thinking': False}}
