n。客户数据通过沙箱提供的 get_connection() 获取 DB-API 连接；禁止编造或填写连接参数，禁止使用 pymysql.connect、SQLAlchemy create_engine、读取平台配置或输出任何凭据。get_connection 由沙箱预置：严禁定义、重写、赋值或写占位实现 def get_connection()，直接调用即可；调用后先判断连接是否为 None，为 None 立即抛出明确错误，不要继续 cursor。只能执行只读 MySQL SELECT 查询，所有条件值使用 cursor.execute(sql, params) 参数绑定，表名使用已提供的库名.表名，字段和 JOIN 必须依据本次实时字段及有效关联关系。使用 try/finally，在结束时 rollback 并关闭连接；get_connection() 不可用时抛出错误，禁止换数据源。按字段注释和技能规则解释业务条件，不臆造字段，不编造数据。每步在独立命名空间执行，前序结果只能从任务指定的衔接字典按键获取，或重新查询。需要向后续步骤传参时，按任务要求 print(\'__HANDOFF__\'+json.dumps({...}))，仅放JSON可序列化对象。MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列与 SUM/AVG/COUNT 结果在 Python 中是 decimal.Decimal：单值先 float()；pandas 整列先 df[col] = df[col].astype(float) 或 df = df.apply(pd.to_numeric, errors=\'coerce\') 再参与除法/百分比运算，禁止 Decimal 与 float 直接混算。用户给出的商品编码/名称/规格可能与数据库真实值不一致：先用 LIKE 对编码、名称、规格等字段模糊探查，确认命中后再精确查询；查询为 0 行时必须更换匹配方式重试，禁止直接返回空结果。数据结果必须 print 为纯文本表格，不能只用 display 或图表；空结果如实说明。\n\n你是一个精通Python和数据处理的AI修复助手。请只输出纯Python代码。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '你生成的 Python 代码在沙箱中执行时发生了报错。\n【原始任务】: 步骤1：查询海纳动力客户信息及六轴工业机器人、激光测距仪、位移传感器对应的ERP商品ID、标准售价及当前可用库存\n【你的代码】:\n```python\nimport json\nfrom decimal import Decimal\n\nconn = get_connection()\nif conn is None:\n    raise Exception("Database connection failed")\n\ncursor = conn.cursor(dictionary=True)\n\ntry:\n    # 1. Query Customer Info for "海纳动力"\n    sql_customer = """\n        SELECT id, customer_code, customer_name \n        FROM nova_crm.crm_customer \n        WHERE customer_name LIKE %s AND is_deleted = 0\n    """\n    cursor.execute(sql_customer, (\'%海纳动力%\',))\n    customers = cursor.fetchall()\n    \n    if not customers:\n        print("No customer found matching \'海纳动力\'")\n        handoff_data = {}\n    else:\n        # Take the first match as the primary customer\n        target_customer = customers[0]\n        customer_id = target_customer[\'id\']\n        customer_code = target_customer[\'customer_code\']\n        customer_name = target_customer[\'customer_name\']\n        \n        # 2. Query Product Info and Inventory for the specified items\n        # Items: 六轴工业机器人 (SKU: 六轴-253), 激光测距仪 (SKU: 激光-598), 位移传感器 (SKU: 位移-369)\n        # Note: The user provided names like "六轴-253", which likely correspond to product_code or spec.\n        # We will search by product_code or name/spec containing these identifiers.\n        \n        product_queries = [\n            {\'name\': \'六轴工业机器人\', \'code_hint\': \'六轴-253\'},\n            {\'name\': \'激光测距仪\', \'code_hint\': \'激光-598\'},\n            {\'name\': \'位移传感器\', \'code_hint\': \'位移-369\'}\n        ]\n        \n        results = []\n        \n        for item in product_queries:\n            hint = item[\'code_hint\']\n            # Search in erp_product for code or name matching the hint\n            sql_product = """\n                SELECT id, product_code, product_name, sale_price, unit\n                FROM nova_erp.erp_product\n                WHERE (product_code LIKE %s OR product_name LIKE %s OR spec LIKE %s) AND is_deleted = 0\n                LIMIT 1\n            """\n            # Using LIKE with wildcards around the hint to find matches\n            pattern = f\'%{hint}%\'\n            cursor.execute(sql_product, (pattern, pattern, pattern))\n            prod = cursor.fetchone()\n            \n            if not prod:\n                # Fallback: try searching just by the numeric part if the prefix format differs\n                # But given the prompt structure, let\'s assume the hint is sufficient for now.\n                # If strict match fails, we might need broader search, but let\'s stick to the hint first.\n                pass\n            \n            if prod:\n                product_id = prod[\'id\']\n                product_code = prod[\'product_code\']\n                product_name = prod[\'product_name\']\n                sale_price = float(prod[\'sale_price\']) if prod[\'sale_price\'] is not None else 0.0\n                \n                # Get Material ID linked to this Product to check inventory\n                # erp_material.product_id -> erp_product.id\n                sql_material_inv = """\n                    SELECT m.id as material_id, m.material_name, SUM(i.available_qty) as total_available_qty\n                    FROM nova_erp.erp_material m\n                    LEFT JOIN nova_erp.erp_inventory i ON m.id = i.material_id\n                    WHERE m.product_id = %s AND m.is_deleted = 0\n                    GROUP BY m.id, m.material_name\n                """\n                cursor.execute(sql_material_inv, (product_id,))\n                inv_rows = cursor.fetchall()\n                \n                available_qty = 0\n                material_info = ""\n                if inv_rows:\n                    # Assuming one main material per product for simplicity in this context, \n                    # or summing up all materials linked to this product ID\n                    for row in inv_rows:\n                        qty = row[\'total_available_qty\']\n                        if qty is not None:\n                            available_qty += float(qty)\n                        material_info += f"{row[\'material_name\']}({row[\'material_id\']}): {float(qty) if qty else 0}, "\n                \n                results.append({\n                    \'product_id\': product_id,\n                    \'product_code\': product_code,\n                    \'product_name\': product_name,\n                    \'unit\': prod[\'unit\'],\n                    \'standard_sale_price\': sale_price,\n                    \'available_stock\': available_qty,\n                    \'requested_qty\': 10,\n                    \'stock_sufficient\': available_qty >= 10\n                })\n            else:\n                results.append({\n                    \'product_id\': None,\n                    \'product_code\': hint,\n                    \'product_name\': item[\'name\'],\n                    \'unit\': \'\',\n                    \'standard_sale_price\': 0.0,\n                    \'available_stock\': 0,\n                    \'requested_qty\': 10,\n                    \'stock_sufficient\': False,\n                    \'error\': \'Product not found\'\n                })\n\n        # Print Results Table\n        print(f"Customer: {customer_name} ({customer_code})")\n        print("-" * 100)\n        header = f"{\'Product Name\':<20} | {\'Code\':<15} | {\'Std Price\':>10} | {\'Req Qty\':>8} | {\'Avail Stock\':>12} | {\'Sufficient?\':>10}"\n        print(header)\n        print("-" * 100)\n        \n        total_contract_value = 0\n        \n        for r in results:\n            p_name = r[\'product_name\'][:18] + ".." if len(r[\'product_name\']) > 20 else r[\'product_name\']\n            p_code = r[\'product_code\']\n            price = r[\'standard_sale_price\']\n            req = r[\'requested_qty\']\n            avail = r[\'available_stock\']\n            suff = "Yes" if r[\'stock_sufficient\'] else "No"\n            \n            line_val = price * req\n            total_contract_value += line_val\n            \n            print(f"{p_name:<20} | {p_code:<15} | {price:>10.2f} | {req:>8} | {avail:>12.2f} | {suff:>10}")\n            \n        print("-" * 100)\n        print(f"Total Estimated Contract Value (Standard Prices): {total_contract_value:.2f}")\n        \n        # Prepare Handoff Data\n        valid_products = [r for r in results if r[\'product_id\'] is not None]\n        handoff_data = {\n            \'customer_id\': customer_id,\n            \'customer_code\': customer_code,\n            \'products\': [\n                {\n                    \'product_id\': r[\'product_id\'],\n                    \'product_code\': r[\'product_code\'],\n                    \'quantity\': r[\'requested_qty\'],\n                    \'standard_price\': r[\'standard_sale_price\']\n                } for r in valid_products\n            ]\n        }\n\n    print(\'__HANDOFF__\' + json.dumps(handoff_data))\n\nfinally:\n    cursor.close()\n    conn.rollback()\n    conn.close()\n```\n【执行报错】:\nError: TypeError: Connection.cursor() got an unexpected keyword argument \'dictionary\'\n\n请仔细分析报错原因并修复代码。注意：\n1. 如果是 SQL 语法或字段找不到错误，请检查 JOIN 条件、表别名或使用的数据表字段名是否正确。\n2. 如果是 Pandas 数据处理报错，请检查 DataFrame 的类型或缺失值。\n3. 如果是 __HANDOFF__ 打印报错（如 json 序列化失败），请只放入可 JSON 序列化的简单参数（int/float/str/列表），并把 DataFrame 等对象排除在外。\n4. 如果报错涉及 decimal.Decimal 与 float 混算（unsupported operand type(s) for /、+、-、*），说明 MySQL 的 DECIMAL 列或 SUM/AVG 聚合结果返回的是 Decimal，必须在参与除法、百分比等运算前转成 float：单值用 float(x)；pandas 整列用 df[col] = df[col].astype(float) 或 df = df.apply(pd.to_numeric, errors=\'coerce\') 后再运算，不要在未转换的 Series 上直接做算术；round() 之后也要 float() 才能 json.dumps。\n5. 如果提示“无输出”，说明代码执行完没有 print 任何内容。请补上 print(...)，把本步结果（如 df.to_string(index=False) 或关键数值）以纯文本打印出来，否则后续步骤和最终总结拿不到数据。\n6. 如果报错提到“定义了 get_connection()”或 \'NoneType\' object has no attribute \'cursor\'，说明你在代码里自己定义或占位实现了 get_connection。该函数由沙箱预置，必须删掉你的 def get_connection，直接调用 get_connection()，也不要给 get_connection 赋值。\n7. 如果提示“衔接参数为空”，说明本步 SQL 条件没匹配到数据：用户给的编号/名称可能只是规格或名称片段，与库里的商品编码并不一致。请先用 LIKE 对商品编码、商品名称、规格型号等字段做模糊探查，确认数据库里真实存在的值后再精确查询，并确保 __HANDOFF__ 里传入的是真实命中的非空结果，不要直接输出空列表。\n请输出修复后的纯 Python 代码内容，不要包含任何 Markdown 标记（如 ```python 等）。'}], 'model': 'qwen3.8-flash', 'temperature': 0.3}, 'extra_json': {'enable_thinking': False}}
